    "items": [],
    "id": "page_section_element$1fdab163-c17a-4e01-9f3c-82679eb28920",
    "slice_type": "page_section_element",
    "slice_label": null
   },
   {
    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "As a general rule, we strive for authenticity in our communications and brand, and want to showcase real Aalto people in authentic environments in our videos as well.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "For videos meant for an external audience, and especially in social media, please note that:",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- People tend to decide based on the first 2-10 seconds whether they want to watch the video or not.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- The very beginning of the video should be captivating. Avoid long introductions and go straight to the point. What is the ‘hook’ in your story?",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- The visuals in the beginning of the video should be as interesting as possible. A “talking head” is not always considered that fascinating, unless it’s a well-known person.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- Think about what makes your topic engaging for the general / international audience? What would you tell a friend about it at a party? Avoid Aalto jargon, abbreviations or internal information related to courses, projects, events etc. ",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Since video format can be cumbersome to update, consider making timeless materials by omitting dates or years in the storytelling.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "For example, if you want to create a video ad for summer school with a call-to-action “Apply by 5th of April 2025”, the video could say “Apply now” and you can provide more information about dates in the social media copy text, or other context, when sharing the video. Thus the video could be used for the same purpose for several years.",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 0,
         "end": 338,
         "type": "em"
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      }
     ],
     "component_id": null,
     "component_figma_link": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "plain_component_preview": false,
