     ],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "All videos published officially under Aalto University should be captioned according to the EU accessibility directive. The captions can be either burned-in the video (i.e. for Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn) or delivered as a separate captions file (Youtube, Panopto, Workday).",
