       "text": "- Fun / inspirational social media video: 15 - 90 seconds.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- Video for self-development / learning (high motivation to watch): 2 - 120 minutes.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- Inspirational / informative video to be shown at events: 2-3 minutes.",
